{
  "name": "02 - Smart Gmail Reply Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 - Smart Gmail Reply Assistant\n\n**Flow:** New unread INBOX email (or Manual Test: fetches your latest real unread email) -> Config -> Clean Email (strip HTML/quotes, detect Arabic/English) -> Skip Unwanted (no-reply, newsletters, your own emails, already labeled) -> AI classifies type + urgency -> AI writes a reply in the sender's language -> auto-send or save as Gmail draft -> label the email -> Telegram notification.\n\n**Credentials:** Gmail OAuth2, OpenAI API, Telegram Bot API.\n\n**autoSendTypes:** edit it in the Config node. `[]` (current) saves every reply as a draft; `[\"inquiry\"]` auto-sends inquiries; e.g. `[\"inquiry\",\"quote_request\"]` auto-sends both.\n\n**No double replies:** every handled email gets the label `auto-replied` (or `spam-filtered`), and Skip Unwanted ignores emails that already have it.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b8dd7673-ceda-4a08-9032-fbadbf19ae8a",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1504,
        240
      ]
    },
